[ACT] fill 'Email': {{email}}
[ACT] fill 'Password': {{password}}
[ACT] click 'Sign in'
[WAIT] sign-in attempt settles

Assertions:
[NETWORK] the sign-in attempt receives HTTP 400 on /connect/token {OBSERVED}
[DOM] the sign-in form surfaces an error indicating access to the organization has been blocked (message observed: "Your access to this organization has been blocked") {OBSERVED}
[STATE] no authenticated session is established — the rep never reaches an authenticated state, so {{locked_org}}'s profile at /company/my-customers/{{locked_org}} is unreachable by construction (no session exists to attempt navigation with) {SPEC}

[DOM] a "Quick actions" widget/section is visible on the profile page alongside Customer information, Orders, and Sales widgets {OBSERVED}
[DOM] the Quick actions widget is visible with exactly 4 tiles arranged in a 2x2 grid {DOC}
[DOM] the "Send email" tile is visible and enabled (not greyed out) {OBSERVED}

[DOM] the communication modal is absent (closed) after a successful send {OBSERVED}
[DOM] a success toast/notification is visible {OBSERVED}
[STATE] the profile page (Customer information / Orders / Sales widgets) remains rendered and interactive after the modal closes {OBSERVED}

[DOM] the customer-communication modal opens with Title, Message, Email and Push fields all visible and not clipped at 768px {OBSERVED}
[DOM] the Cancel and Send buttons are both visible/reachable in the modal footer {OBSERVED}
[DOM] the modal subtitle names @td(ORG_ACME.name) — the profile's own organization {OBSERVED}
